{"arguments": null, "input": "const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /work/spec.k\\n@@\\n-      => L |-> scope((\\\"a\\\" |-> G:Int\\n+      => L |-> scope((\\\"a\\\" |-> ?G:Int\\n@@\\n-    ensures G >=Int 0\\n-      andBool commonDivisor(G, A, B)\\n-      andBool (notBool commonDivisor(D, A, B) orBool dividesZ(D, G))\\n+    ensures ?G >=Int 0\\n+      andBool commonDivisor(?G, A, B)\\n+      andBool (notBool commonDivisor(D, A, B) orBool dividesZ(D, ?G))\\n@@\\n-      => G:Int\\n+      => ?G:Int\\n@@\\n-    ensures G >=Int 0\\n-      andBool commonDivisor(G, absInt(A0), absInt(B0))\\n+    ensures ?G >=Int 0\\n+      andBool commonDivisor(?G, absInt(A0), absInt(B0))\\n@@\\n-               orBool dividesZ(D, G))\\n+               orBool dividesZ(D, ?G))\\n*** End Patch\";\nconst a = await tools.apply_patch(patch);\nconst r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"kprove spec.k --definition verification-kompiled --spec-module GCD-SPEC\",workdir:\"/work\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:12000});\ntext(a);\ntext(JSON.stringify(r));", "line": 128, "message": null, "name": "exec", "phase": null, "type": "custom_tool_call"}
